        "subject": "LU-18806 tests: except sanityn/80a for older clients",
        "message": "LU-18806 tests: except sanityn/80a for older clients\n\nClients older than v2_16_53-41-g8a5e155235 run a sanityn test_80a\nthat expects \"lfs migrate\" of a directory with an open file to fail.\nMDSes with that change skip the open file and complete the migration,\nso 80a fails in interop testing with those clients, e.g.\n\"migrate open files should failed with open files\".\n\nAdd lustre/tests/except/sanityn.ex so that older clients skip 80a.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanityn mdtcount=2 env=ONLY=80a,HONOR_EXCEPT=y\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanityn mdtcount=2 env=ONLY=80a,HONOR_EXCEPT=y clientversion=2.15\nFixes: 8a5e155235cf (\"LU-18806 dne: migrate to skip non-migratable files\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: Iea76ec81746b5d3d44f0396220d6664ebb3ebbe5\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/70627\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Alex Deiter <adeiter@ddn.com>\nReviewed-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
